 "intro_zh": "水洞沟是中国最早发掘的旧石器时代文化遗址。独特的雅丹地貌鬼斧神工地造就了魔鬼城、摩天崖、大峡谷等奇绝景观，它们和蓝天、碧水、断崖、芦苇、鸳鸯、野鸭共同构筑了宁静逸然的世外桃源。",
 "intro_en": "Shuidonggou is an archaeological site and tourist attraction in Ordos, Yinchuan, Ningxia. It is the earliest paleolithic site in China, dating from over 30,000 years ago, and one of the AAAAA Tourist Attractions of China, a list of the most important and best-maintained tourist attractions in the People's Republic of China.",
